{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28479","headline":"和野人殷潜之题筹笔驿十四韵 · 杜牧","name":"和野人殷潜之题筹笔驿十四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三吴裂婺女，九锡狱孤儿。\n霸主业未半，本朝心是谁。\n永安宫受诏，筹笔驿沈思。\n画地乾坤在，濡毫胜负知。\n艰难同草创，得失计毫厘。\n寂默经千虑，分明浑一期。\n川流萦智思，山耸助扶持。\n慷慨匡时畧，从容问罪师。\n褒中秋鼓角，渭曲晚旌旗。\n仗义悬无敌，鸣攻故有辞。\n若非天夺去，岂复虑能支。\n子夜星才落，鸿毛鼎便移。\n邮亭世自换，白日事长垂。\n何处躬耕者，犹题殄瘁诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}